[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27303.59, "timestamp": "07:35:03", "text": "洛諾斯菲爾·"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27317.51, "timestamp": "07:35:17", "text": "哦，這些沒有語音提示，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27325.35, "timestamp": "07:35:25", "text": "因為我猜這些是支線任務，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27328.85, "timestamp": "07:35:28", "text": "也許是世界任務。 [音樂][音樂] 我搞砸了，兄弟。"}]